  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevention Pregnancy of Adolescent through protection of SRHR in Buyende and Luuka District, Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1 Service providers and health facilities take action to provide quality adolescent friendly, gender responsive and inclusive SRH services, 2 Adolescents and Young People have increased knowledge understanding and uptake of SRH services and are able to make healthy and informed choices related to their sexual health and rights, 3 Community, including parents, and caregivers (m/f) are able to challenge harmful norms and practices related to their children&apos;s ASRHR, and support them to access SRH services and commodities1. &#xCCAD;&#xC18C;&#xB144; &#xCE5C;&#xD654;&#xC801;&#xC774;&#xACE0; &#xC820;&#xB354;&#xD3EC;&#xC6A9;&#xC801;&#xC778; &#xC131;&#xC7AC;&#xC0DD;&#xC0B0;&#xAC74;&#xAC15; &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4;&#xB97C; &#xC81C;&#xACF5;&#xD558;&#xB294; &#xBCF4;&#xAC74;&#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xBC0F; &#xAD00;&#xACC4;&#xC790;
2. &#xC131;&#xC7AC;&#xC0DD;&#xC0B0;&#xAC74;&#xAC15; &#xBC0F; &#xAD8C;&#xB9AC;&#xC5D0; &#xAE30;&#xBC18;&#xD55C; &#xACB0;&#xC815;&#xC744; &#xD558;&#xACE0; &#xAD00;&#xB828; &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4;&#xB97C; &#xC774;&#xC6A9;&#xD558;&#xB294; &#xCCAD;&#xC18C;&#xB144;
3. &#xCCAD;&#xC18C;&#xB144; &#xC131;&#xC7AC;&#xC0DD;&#xC0B0;&#xAC74;&#xAC15;/&#xAD8C;&#xB9AC;&#xC5D0; &#xB300;&#xD55C; &#xC720;&#xD574;&#xD55C; &#xAD00;&#xC2B5;&#xC5D0; &#xB300;&#xD55C; &#xBCC0;&#xD654;&#xB97C; &#xB3C4;&#xBAA8;&#xD558;&#xACE0; &#xCCAD;&#xC18C;&#xB144;&#xC758; &#xC131;&#xC7AC;&#xC0DD;&#xC0B0;&#xAC74;&#xAC15;&#xAD8C;&#xACFC; &#xAD00;&#xB828; &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xC774;&#xC6A9;&#xC744; &#xC9C0;&#xC9C0;&#xD558;&#xB294; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC0AC;&#xD68C;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health facilities with adolescent-friendly service provision capabilities, Health facilities implementing improvement plans to provide quality sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR) services, Health facilities with GBV response capabilities, Adolescents with accurate knowledge of sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR), Communities with increased awareness of sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR)</narrative>
  </description>
